#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube1.28.0"
msgid "Reference: Hot Dog Generators"
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube1.28.2"
msgid "Following the dismantling of the ~Superspace Hot Dawg~ franchise (pushed out of the picture by the increasing popularity of ~International~ ~House~ of ~Gruel~), a cache of top-secret rapid hot dog generators were discovered in a sold research warehouse on ~Camanis~."
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube1.28.7"
msgid "These generators were capable of synthesizing and elongating pork nodules at 16ms each, vapor-cooking them within 2ms, and synthesizing the bun directly outside of the meat simulatneously.  ~SynthaMustard~ was then applied using high-speed ~mustard-jet~ apparatus.  In effect, within 20ms of placing the order a hot-dog simulacrum could be created and delivered out of the pressurized chamber to a waiting customer.  Most generators were equipped with as many as 20 simultaneous generation chambers."
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube1.28.15"
msgid "These were intended for very saturated markets and would have reduced costs over time by 50%.  In fact, experts speculate that if this ~Hot Dawg~ research had been completed a few minutes sooner, the takeover bid could have been averted and the company saved."
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube1.28.20"
msgid "However, this cruel twist of fate prompted a black-market for hot dog generators to feed luxury-class citizens and host international barbecues. In addition, at least one report claims that if the nozzles were tampered with these generators could be dangerous weapons in the wrong hands."
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 목록에 나오는 제목 (작은 글씨, 두 줄까지). 최대 240바이트 (한글 약 80자)
